        </div>
        
        <div class="challenge-description">
            <p>Start with the micro-lab. Create the Logbook class and connect it to Player.</p>
            <p>Then explore the station: use <code>look</code>, <code>go</code>, <code>take</code>, <code>drop</code>, and <code>inventory</code> commands.</p>
            <p>Tips: type <code>help</code> for commands, and use keyword matching for items (e.g., <code>take crowbar</code>). Each room also shows an ASCII map (@ you, ? items, N NPCs, X enemies).</p>
            <p>Encounters can trigger in some rooms. The engine prints the combat options for you — just type a number. If you want to avoid fights, choose <strong>Run</strong> when available.</p>
            <p>Then answer the code reading questions above by examining the engine files.</p>
        </div>
        
